..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : LABDIFF.ME
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Funktion       : Maskeintritt, Standardwerte fr Feldern setzen
.. Functionality  : Mask entry, set default values to fields
...Includes       :
..  include dfue/LABDIFF.SCREENCONTEXT.FOP
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Start empty
.make screen line -- ? M|tzeilen > 0
..
.. Show table for difflist and registers for lab/fab/vab
.input "dfue/LABDIFF.SCREENCONTEXT.FOP"
..
.. Set default date range: current year if july or later; last year if earlier
.type text xyear
.formula U|xyear =   F|year(G|datum)
.formula U|xyear = ( F|year(G|datum) - 1 )  ?  F|month(G|datum)<7
.formula M|klabhisvon = ("0000" + U|xyear + "0101") >>8
.formula M|klabhisbis = "."
..
.. Set start date for diff list
.protection  klabdiffstart 0
.formula M|klabdiffstart = ""
.copy M|kbdiffkomplett = G|false
.copy M|kbdiffeingang  = G|false
.copy M|kbdiffabterm   = G|true
..
.. Customer product number is read only
.protection kkuartnr 0
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
